ractor may result in disciplinary action.","context":"4.3","section":"business and/or commercial purposes for collecting and selling their personal information;","block":495,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-325374","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001140536","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1140536/000119312526325374/wtw-ex10_2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/b47c119cc5d7721a837ce1da718a87aa3e41ba6dacd175957474ee57bce37d4f.bin","sha256":"b47c119cc5d7721a837ce1da718a87aa3e41ba6dacd175957474ee57bce37d4f"}},{"id":"fe8fd6c2cb8a4bd3cfec61bc2ee223c84220649a6504934bcf71420a220d7e6b","quote":"This Policy is a key element of Willis Towers Watson's Global Privacy Framework and as such it applies in conjunction with all other policies and procedures established by WTW at group, regional and local country level which address the legal requirements and business needs applicable to the processing of data. In particular, the principles in this document must be applied in accordance with the WTW Global Privacy Policy, the Information Security Policy and the Global Records Management Policy.","context":"4.4","section":"business and/or commercial purposes for collecting and selling their personal information;","block":497,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-325374","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001140536","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1140536/000119312526325374/wtw-ex10_2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/b47c119cc5d7721a837ce1da718a87aa3e41ba6dacd175957474ee57bce37d4f.bin","sha256":"b47c119cc5d7721a837ce1da718a87aa3e41ba6dacd175957474ee57bce37d4f"}},{"id":"44f98c412d64a95acd228336ccc2e65743d45786277bd66a4e4b9e05227d53b0","quote":"The policies and procedures that comprise the WTW Global Privacy Framework, including the WTW Global Privacy Policy are available from the Chief Privacy Officer.","context":"4.5","section":"business and/or commercial purposes for collecting and selling their personal information;","block":499,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-325374","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001140536","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1140536/000119312526325374/wtw-ex10_2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/b47c119cc5d7721a837ce1da718a87aa3e41ba6dacd175957474ee57bce37d4f.bin","sha256":"b47c119cc5d7721a837ce1da718a87aa3e41ba6dacd175957474ee57bce37d4f"}},{"id":"c78161fb558cd9b39e617b66c32f7ec964f79b57a6ad166f4e2fcb9ef0ad32dc","quote":"If you require more information about data privacy and how the rules set out in this Policy affect WTW companies, you, or third parties, please contact the Chief Privacy Officer.","context":"4.6","section":"business and/or commercial purposes for collecting and selling their personal information;","block":502,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-325374","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-07-30","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001140536","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1140536/000119312526325374/wtw-ex10_2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/b47c119cc5d7721a837ce1da718a87aa3e41ba6dacd175957474ee57bce37d4f.bin","sha256":"b47c119cc5d7721a837ce1da718a87aa3e41ba6dacd175957474ee57bce37d4f"}},{"id":"b2f1733f6fdf27a8a5a4f53166c5469cdf0b6a91f4f25e276d29186b5b8a6945","quote":"The Rules on processing special categories of personal information","context":"5.","section":"business and/or commercial purposes for collecting and selling their personal information;","block":504,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independent